Z||000078||sqoach||04-16-2001||05:38 PM||||The windshield wipers coming on by themselves is normal.<P>When you fix something, go back and fix it again.<P>You work on your Fiero more than you drive it.<P>When unsuspecting rain clouds roll in, your electric window that is down will not go up.<P>Your Fiero has a huge appetite for tools. Plan on buying a new set every month.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach2.JPG">   <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||10
